<header class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div>
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">PLATFORM &middot; PT-04 &middot; NAVIGATION READY</div>
      <h1>Google Maps gets you to the station.<br>RailNav gets you to your platform.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Large stations like New Delhi, Bengaluru, and Kanpur Central can be a maze of
        exits, escalators, and foot-over-bridges. RailNav turns that maze into
        turn-by-turn walking directions — from where you're standing to exactly
        where you need to be.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Find Your Way — Free</a>
        <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-outline">See How It Works</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="board">
      <div class="board-header">
        <span>Live Route</span>
        <span>Status</span>
      </div>
      <div class="board-row">
        <span>Waiting Hall &rarr; Platform 6</span>
        <span class="flap">420 m</span>
        <span class="status-ontime">6 MIN</span>
      </div>
      <div class="board-row">
        <span>Food Court &rarr; Platform 1</span>
        <span class="flap">180 m</span>
        <span class="status-ontime">3 MIN</span>
      </div>
      <div class="board-row">
        <span>Main Exit &rarr; Platform 9</span>
        <span class="flap">560 m</span>
        <span class="status-ontime">8 MIN</span>
      </div>
      <div class="board-row">
        <span>Metro Entrance &rarr; Platform 4</span>
        <span class="flap">300 m</span>
        <span class="status-ontime">5 MIN</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section" id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Built for how stations actually work</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Every feature answers a real problem passengers face inside a busy terminal.</p>

    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">🧭</div>
        <h3>Shortest walking route</h3>
        <p>Pick your current spot and your destination — RailNav calculates the shortest path through the station's actual layout.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">🪜</div>
        <h3>Step-by-step navigation</h3>
        <p>Not just "go to Platform 4." Real instructions: escalators, bridges, turns, and distances at every step.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">🧴</div>
        <h3>Facility finder</h3>
        <p>Washrooms, ATMs, medical rooms, retiring rooms, food courts — search and locate every facility in the station.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">📝</div>
        <h3>Complaints & suggestions</h3>
        <p>Report issues directly and track their resolution status — or suggest improvements to the station experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">⭐</div>
        <h3>Rate your navigation</h3>
        <p>Rate how accurate and helpful your route was, so the system keeps improving station by station.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="icon">🗂️</div>
        <h3>Your travel history</h3>
        <p>Every search is saved to your profile, so repeat routes through familiar stations are one click away.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-alt" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">How it works</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Four steps between you and your platform.</p>

    <div class="steps-row">
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <h3>Select your station</h3>
        <p class="text-muted">Choose from major stations like New Delhi, Bengaluru, and Kanpur Central.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <h3>Set current location</h3>
        <p class="text-muted">Tell RailNav where you're standing — an exit, a lounge, a platform.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <h3>Pick your destination</h3>
        <p class="text-muted">Your platform, a facility, or an exit — anywhere on the station graph.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-num">04</div>
        <h3>Follow the steps</h3>
        <p class="text-muted">Get distance, time, and clear walking instructions all the way there.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
